      "start_seconds": 254.05,
      "end_seconds": 266.01,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "I'll start you on benzylpenicillin, 600 milligrams, once now, single dose. That's for possible meningococcal sepsis. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well"
